"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Precision Oncology Diagnostics - Tumor Molecular Diagnosis &amp; Genetic Risk Assessment\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A1A2E] via-[#2D2D44] to-[#1B4D3E] text-white py-20 md:py-32 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\"><div class=\"absolute top-20 left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-white rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"container-custom relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm mb-6\">MedKungfu HEALTHCARE · CONCIERGE</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight\">精准肿瘤诊断服务</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 text-gray-200\">肿瘤分子诊断 · 遗传风险评估 · 精准分型与用药指导</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-sm md:text-base mb-12\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full\">MICM-P整合诊断</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full\">CAP + ISO15189双认证</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full\">1500+检测项目</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-1\">7</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300\">在运医院</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-1\">1500+</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300\">检测项目</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-1\">近20种</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300\">覆盖疾病类型</div></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl p-4\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-1\">CAP+ISO</div><div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-300\">国际双认证</div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6 text-center\">关于高博诊断中心</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">我们的合作诊断中心是中国领先的临床导向型肿瘤精准诊断机构，采用国际标准的MICM-P整合诊断模式（形态学、免疫学、细胞遗传学、分子生物学、病理学），专注于血液恶性肿瘤及复杂实体肿瘤的精准诊断、治疗评估与转化研究。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">诊断中心覆盖北京、上海、广东三大区域，拥有多家参考实验室及中心实验室，实验室总面积超7000平方米。核心团队均拥有超30年检验与诊断研究经验，每年开展约30个研发项目，拥有十余项实用新型专利。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">对于无法亲自到院的海外患者，诊断中心支持远程服务：可通过邮寄石蜡包埋或病理切片的方式提交病理会诊及基因检测申请。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-yellow-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-yellow-100 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 p-6 rounded-r-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-yellow-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-2\">重要说明</h3><p class=\"text-yellow-700 text-sm leading-relaxed\">本诊断服务用于肿瘤风险评估和精准诊断，不替代临床诊断。所有检测结果均需结合病理、影像及临床医生综合评估，方可作为诊断依据。阴性结果不等于无风险。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"packages\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">四大精准诊断套餐</h2><p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">根据患者就诊路径与现有标本情况，诊断中心提供定制化精准诊断方案。以下四种套餐分别对应不同阶段的诊断需求，可单项选择或组合使用。</p><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F5F7FA] to-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">01</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">肿瘤精准诊断包</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 italic\">已有影像异常、病理疑点、复发或难分型病例</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">病理会诊：HE染色 + 免疫组化（定性病理复阅）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">600+基因NGS检测：肿瘤分子分型、预后评估</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">整合诊断报告：融合分子诊断结果与病理结论</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">治疗方向参考建议：依据分型结果提供参考意见</span></li></ul><div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-800\"><span class=\"font-bold\">⚠️ </span>检测结果不替代病理诊断，需结合影像及临床医生建议做出最终诊断</p></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>参考周期：病理会诊 5–7 工作日；NGS基因检测 10–15 工作日</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F5F7FA] to-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">02</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">肿瘤遗传风险评估包</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 italic\">有家族史、早发肿瘤史、既往肿瘤史的个人或家属</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">肿瘤遗传易感基因检测（900+基因面板）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">覆盖血液肿瘤及实体肿瘤相关遗传易感基因（NCCN/CSCO推荐）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">遗传风险评估报告及随访建议方案</span></li></ul><div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-800\"><span class=\"font-bold\">⚠️ </span>本包用于遗传风险评估，阴性结果不等于无风险；需结合临床医生作进一步评估</p></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>参考周期：18–23 工作日</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F5F7FA] to-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">03</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">疑难肿瘤二次会诊包</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 italic\">外院诊断不明确、希望获得第二意见的患者</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">原始病理材料复核（切片、石蜡包埋、病理报告）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">病理切片复阅（HE + 免疫组化，如原有检测不足可补充项目）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">分子检测补全（如原有检测不完整，补充NGS、FISH等）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">多学科专家意见书（整合所有检测结果、提供临床建议）</span></li></ul><div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-800\"><span class=\"font-bold\">⚠️ </span>意见书为参考性资料，不取代正式病理诊断报告；最终诊断仍需临床医生确认</p></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>参考周期：根据材料完整度分段出具，具体周期请与工作人员确认</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F5F7FA] to-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">04</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">治疗前分子分型包</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 italic\">已确诊肿瘤、准备选药或制定治疗方案的患者</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">800+基因NGS（ctDNA血液或组织）：全肿瘤靶点及分型分析</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">MSI / TMB检测：免疫治疗潜在获益评估</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">PD-L1蛋白表达：免疫检查点抗体用药参考</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">药物靶点、耐药性、PARP抑制剂相关基因分析</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">类器官芯片药敏测试（可选）：个体化用药参考</span></li></ul><div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-800\"><span class=\"font-bold\">⚠️ </span>检测结果为治疗决策提供分子参考依据，最终用药方案需由主治医生确认</p></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>参考周期：NGS 10–20 工作日；PD-L1 8 工作日；类器官芯片 15–20 工作日</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">主要检测项目参考价格</h2><p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">以下为主要单项检测的参考价格（美元），实际费用因样本类型及组合方案有所差异。FFPE石蜡块样本另加基础处理费 $310 + 每块 $20。套餐价格请联系咨询。</p><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white\"><div class=\"p-6 font-bold\">检测项目</div><div class=\"p-6 font-bold text-center\">参考价格（USD）</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">病理会诊（标准）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$1,800</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">病理会诊（专家级）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$2,300</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">Pan-Cancer 600+基因面板（组织）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$2,500</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">Pan-Cancer 800+基因面板（组织）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$3,900</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">Pan-Cancer 800+基因面板（ctDNA 血液）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$4,300</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">321基因面板（组织）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$2,700</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">321基因面板（ctDNA 血液）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$3,100</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">PD-L1 蛋白表达检测</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$1,000</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">肿瘤融合 / 重排 RNA 检测</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$2,500</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">全外显子组测序（WES，组织）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$6,000</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">血液肿瘤深度测序（339 基因）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$1,900</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-gray-100\"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">肿瘤转录组测序（RNA-seq）</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$1,700</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 \"><div class=\"p-6 font-medium text-[#1A1A2E]\">类器官芯片药敏测试</div><div class=\"p-6 text-center text-[#1B4D3E] font-bold\">$6,400</div></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-6 text-center\">* 以上价格以美元计价，仅供参考；最终报价以实验室确认为准。MedKungfu可协助安排报价及付款流程。</p></div></div></section><section id=\"capabilities\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">技术能力与资质</h2><p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">MICM-P整合诊断是本次合作诊断中心的核心方法论：形态学（M）+ 免疫学（I）+ 细胞遗传学（C）+ 分子生物学（M）+ 病理学（P）各维度协同诊断，而非单一检测指标。这一模式可有效减少误诊漏诊风险，并为病情复杂或少见的患者提供更准确的诊断方向。</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B4D3E]/20 mb-2\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">CAP + ISO15189 国际双认证</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">美国病理学学院（CAP）认可和国际标准化实验室（ISO15189）双认证，是全球实验室质量的最高标准之一。每个检测项目均经内部严格验证和多学科实践，确保结果可靠性。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-test-tube \"><path d=\"M14.5 2v17.5c0 1.4-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5h0c-1.4 0-2.5-1.1-2.5-2.5V2\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path><path d=\"M14.5 16h-5\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B4D3E]/20 mb-2\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">1500+ 检测项目，覆盖血液肿瘤 + 实体肿瘤</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">覆盖血液肿瘤（淋巴瘤、多发性骨髓瘤、白血病等）及近20种实体肿瘤类型，从病理会诊到全外显子组测序均可单项或打包安排。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B4D3E]/20 mb-2\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">支持远程邮寄标本服务</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">对于无法亲自到院的海外患者，可通过MedKungfu协调邮寄石蜡包埋或病理切片进行检测；全程无需亲自赴京就诊。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope \"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B4D3E]/20 mb-2\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">类器官芯片平台（可选增强）</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">类器官芯片平台可对肿瘤组织进行个体化药敏测试，模拟多种治疗方案的实际疗效，为治疗决策提供更多个体化参考。</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"suitable\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-12\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">适合就诊的典型情境</h2><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><ul class=\"space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">影像显示占位或结节，尚未明确性质，需进一步分型</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">外院病理报告提示高级别或复杂亚型，希望得到专业复阅意见</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">已确诊恶性肿瘤，希望了解靶点与免疫治疗相关生物标志物</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">一线治疗后复发或耐药，需重新评估分子分型以调整方案</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">有肿瘤家族史，希望了解个人遗传易感风险并制定随访计划</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mr-4 mt-1 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">在其他机构诊断不明确，希望得到专业精准诊断中心的独立第二意见</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">服务流程 · 国际患者专属通道</h2><p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">MedKungfu为每位患者提供从材料整理到报告解读的全程协调服务。</p><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">1</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">资料整理与初步评估</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed\">提交病历、病理报告及影像资料，MedKungfu协助整理并转交诊断中心初步评估，确认适合的套餐组合。</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>3-5个工作日</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">2</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">专家确认方案</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed\">诊断中心专家远程会诊，确认具体检测项目组合及标本要求，将所需材料清单反馈给患者。</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>5-7个工作日</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">3</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">标本邮寄（石蜡包埋 / 切片）</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed\">对于无法亲自到院的海外患者，可通过国际邮寄石蜡包埋或病理切片进行检测；MedKungfu协助确认邮寄要求和全程追踪。</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>视物流情况而定</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">4</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">实验室检测与报告</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed\">诊断中心实验室接收标本并开展检验，周期内出具分子诊断报告。如需补标本或质量不达标，会第一时间通知。</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>依检测项目而定</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold\">5</div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">报告解读与后续随访</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed\">专科专家就诊断结果给出临床建议；MedKungfu协助翻译与汇总，并协调后续随访计划。</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm text-[#1B4D3E]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>报告出具后</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"why-us\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-[#1A1A2E] mb-12\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">为什么选择 MedKungfu？</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text \"><path d=\"M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"8\" y1=\"13\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"8\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"17\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y1=\"9\" y2=\"9\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">病案整理与翻译</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">双语专业协调员协助整理病历资料，确保患者与诊断团队零障碍沟通。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">标本邮寄协调</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">协助确认国际邮寄要求和质控标准，配合当地医院安排切片 / 石蜡包埋出院手续。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">报告中文解读</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">诊断报告以中文出具为主，MedKungfu可协助安排专科层面对报告进行解读，确保患者完全理解结果内容。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right \"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">后续诊疗转介</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">如患者希望进一步就诊（CAR-T治疗、神经外科、骨髓移植等），可协助安排内部绿色通道转介。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A1A2E] via-[#2D2D44] to-[#1B4D3E] text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">联系我们 · 一小时内回复</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-4 text-gray-200\">开启您的精准肿瘤诊断之旅</p><p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-8\">联系我们进行免费初步评估，提交病历及影像资料，我们将安排专家进行远程预筛。</p><a href=\"mailto:contact@medkungfu.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-white text-[#1B4D3E] rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg\">contact@medkungfu.com<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/20\"><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">MK · EST. 2026</p></div></div></div></section></main>"